sequenceDiagram
  participant A as client A
  participant B as clients B…J
  participant D as devpi
  A->>+D: GET simple/polars/ (first ever)
  B->>+D: GET simple/polars/ (snapshot taken, waits on the project lock)
  D-->>-A: 200 once the upstream fetch commits
  D-->>-B: 200 empty page, read from the older snapshot
  Note over B: uv reads the empty page as "no version of polars"
